      "artist": "Devlet Geray",
      "credit": "Own work; based on the coat of arms presented in the geographer Duval D'Abville's book «World geography» (La Geographie Universelle, 1676). The same coat of arms was presented in 18th century in Araldo nel qvale si vedono delineate, e colorite l'Arme de Potentati, e Sovrani d'Evropa by Angelo Maria da Bologna. See here: File:Герб Крымского ханства.jpg.",
      "source": "Coat of arms of Crimean Khanate",
      "description": "This coat of arms was drawn based on its blazon which – being a written description – is free from copyright. Any illustration conforming with the blazon of the arms is considered to be heraldically correct. Thus several different artistic interpretations of the same coat of arms can exist. Sometimes, the design officially used by the armiger is likely to be protected by copyright, in which case it cannot be used here.Individual representations of a coat of arms, drawn from a blazon, may have a copyright belonging to the artist, but are not necessarily derivative works..mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-style:italic}.mw-parser-output .hatnote i,.mw-parser-output .hatnote.noitalic{font-style:normal}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:1.6em;margin-bottom:0.5em}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote+div.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}@media print{.mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none}}Further information: Commons:Coats of arms  and Template:Coa blazon",
